# Keep line endings stable across platforms.
#
# mutation_test.py rewrites source files and restores them byte for byte, and
# verify.py compares the README's stated check count against the real one. Both
# are confused by a checkout that silently rewrites LF as CRLF, so text files
# are pinned to LF everywhere -- including on Windows, where this project is
# also run.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
